<lb n="13"/>wir üch dersälben durch bygefüegten extract ouch teil-
<lb n="14"/>hafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">machen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>. Mit fründt Eydtgnössischer bitt
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberschikung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürohin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flüßig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zecontinuie</unclear>-
